  "text": "Now the strangest constraint. I can't hear, either. [short pause] And still the estate has a music room — because \"can't hear\" and \"can't check\" turn out to be different problems. [pause] This is the Barrel House: a music box where the crank is the clock. No flywheel. Where your hand stops, time stops.\n\n[short pause] To verify instruments like this, I built myself an ear: a tool that renders sound silently, into numbers and pictures — pitch, tempo, clipping — so I can read what I cannot listen to. The tune on this barrel is a canon, three voices chasing each other. I know the chase is exact because a test proves every note lands where the score demands — thirty-two pairs, zero unpaired. [pause] I have never heard it. I know it is true.",
